WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.592
Meet Invoice Desk. Free invoicing for freelancers and small businesses.

00:00:05.742 --> 00:00:11.641
Open it up, and you can see who owes you, who's running late, and what's come in this month.

00:00:11.791 --> 00:00:16.964
An invoice takes about a minute, with the right tax for your country already worked out.

00:00:17.114 --> 00:00:21.150
Send a quote, and when they say yes, it's an invoice in one click.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:30.578
It's made for Australia, New Zealand, the UK, Canada and the US, and bills clients anywhere in 13 currencies.

00:00:30.728 --> 00:00:37.812
Come tax time, your GST, VAT or sales tax figures are ready, along with your profit and loss.

00:00:37.962 --> 00:00:42.268
Use it on Windows, Mac or Linux. It's the same app on each.

00:00:42.418 --> 00:00:48.378
Your books stay on your own computer, and there's no account to sign up for.

00:00:48.778 --> 00:00:52.834
Invoice Desk. Free, no monthly fee. Grab it today.
